      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds Proceeds received by the Trust\nfrom the issuance of Baskets consist of INJ. Such deposits are held by the INJ Custodians on behalf of the Trust until (i) delivered out\nin connection with redemptions of Baskets; or (ii) transferred or sold by the Sponsor, which may be facilitated by the INJ Custodians,\nto pay fees due to the Sponsor and Trust expenses and liabilities not assumed by the Sponsor. Emerging Growth Company The Trust is an \u201cemerging\ngrowth company\u201d as defined in the Jumpstart Our Business Startups Act of 2012 (the \u201cJOBS Act\u201d). For as long as the Trust\nis an emerging growth company, unlike other public companies, it will not be required to, among other things: (i) provide an auditor\u2019s\nattestation report on management\u2019s assessment of the effectiveness of our system of internal control over financial reporting pursuant\nto Section 404(b) of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
